---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Markdown from '../components/Markdown.astro';

const supportContent = `
## Support

Welcome to the Jo1nTrX Support page. We're here to help!

### Getting Help

If you need assistance with Jo1nTrX, you have several options:

#### Documentation

Check out our comprehensive documentation to find answers to common questions:

- [Netlify Documentation](https://docs.netlify.com)
- [Astro Documentation](https://docs.astro.build)
- Platform feature guides and tutorials

#### Contact Support

For direct assistance, you can reach our support team:

- **Email**: support@jo1ntrx.com
- **Response Time**: We typically respond within 24-48 hours

### Frequently Asked Questions

**Q: How do I get started with Jo1nTrX?**  
A: Visit our home page for an overview of our platform and features. Our documentation provides step-by-step guides for getting started.

**Q: What technologies does Jo1nTrX use?**  
A: We use Astro for our frontend framework, deployed on Netlify with Edge Functions, Image CDN, and Netlify Blobs for optimal performance.

**Q: How do I add Jo1nTrX to my Discord server?**  
A: Visit our website or contact us for an invite link to add Jo1nTrX™ to your Discord server.

**Q: What about my privacy and data?**  
A: We take your privacy seriously. Please review our [Privacy Policy](/privacy-policy) for detailed information about how we collect, use, and protect your data.

**Q: How can I report a bug or issue?**  
A: Please email us at support@jo1ntrx.com with detailed information about the issue you're experiencing.

### Technical Support

For technical issues related to:

- **Performance**: Edge Functions provide global distribution for optimal speed
- **Media**: Our Image CDN automatically optimizes images
- **Data Storage**: Netlify Blobs offer efficient data management
- **Caching**: Advanced caching strategies with on-demand revalidation

### Community

Join our community to connect with other users, share tips, and get help:

- Follow us on social media
- Participate in community forums
- Subscribe to our newsletter for updates

### Feedback

We value your feedback! If you have suggestions for improving Jo1nTrX, please let us know at support@jo1ntrx.com.
`;
---

<Layout title="Support">
    <h1 class="mb-10">Support</h1>
    <Markdown content={supportContent} class="mb-10" />
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        <a href="mailto:support@jo1ntrx.com" class="btn btn-lg">Contact Support</a>
        <a href="/" class="btn btn-lg">Back to Home</a>
    </div>
</Layout>
